{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S13把“想听到一句以后不变的准话，但明白没人能保证永远”改成“即使听到对方说以后不变，仍然怀疑”，改变了原本的情境和心理动机。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点短语加亮，叙述与感受交替，部分感受又按音乐段落出现，边听边扫更容易抓住每段重点，不必同时处理一大堆短词。X的音乐细节、身体感受和水面船身意象也更具体细腻；但Y的完整叙述在解释人物为什么犹豫、为什么害怕、为什么改变方面更稳，因果交代更充分。整体而言，X的观看体验更好，但Y在心理动机的准确传达上有值得保留的优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "84173551-604f-45b9-ab79-497a6bb2cd52", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T001903385768Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:20:29.014523+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "926c7bd43c263a8a8e032a54bbc24d8a42a322a58718bdd1d8712cc600b8f364", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_